# state/ policy: operational records that must SURVIVE container recycling are
# tracked (this is a private repo — suppression and run status are compliance
# records); bulky regenerable intermediates are not.
state/*
!state/README.md
!state/suppression.json
!state/niche_scores.json
!state/niche.json
!state/last_run_status.json
!state/sam_request_ledger.json
!state/qc-log.md
!state/briefs
!state/outreach
# The filtered prospect list is the audited outreach list (kept + excluded
# with reasons). It is a compliance record -- who we contacted and why we
# ruled others out -- so it survives container recycling like suppression.
!state/prospects-*-filtered.json
# The award scan behind a batch. QC established that several brief claims
# (each firm's cited award description) are verifiable ONLY here -- the
# packets do not carry them -- so it is evidence, not a regenerable
# intermediate: USAspending data moves and a re-run will not reproduce it.
!state/prospect_scan-*.json
# SAM entity data (UEI, registration status, POC name) behind the outreach
# list, plus the queue of firms still needing a UEI-keyed lookup. Compliance
# record: it is the evidence for who was contacted and why.
!state/entities-*.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
